      "start_seconds": 1.36,
      "end_seconds": 5.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.71,
      "end_seconds": 10.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.36,
      "end_seconds": 18.43,
      "duration_seconds": 7.07,
      "text": "Yeah, it's aching muscles in my thighs. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.93,
      "end_seconds": 26.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.53,
      "end_seconds": 31.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "It's been going on for about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.35,
      "end_seconds": 36.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.97,
      "end_seconds": 45.64,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "So, you know, I notice it more with stairs. It feels severe to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.92,
      "end_seconds": 50.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.9,
      "end_seconds": 61.34,
      "duration_seconds": 10.44,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago. I walk the dog every morning. My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.73,
      "end_seconds": 65.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.21,
      "end_seconds": 69.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "No, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.56,
      "end_seconds": 74.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.18,
      "end_seconds": 77.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "No, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.5,
      "end_seconds": 82.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Okay, have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.25,
      "end_seconds": 88.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Um, no, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.61,
      "end_seconds": 105.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.86,
      "end_seconds": 115.95,
      "duration_seconds": 10.09,
      "text": "Well, uh, years back I got swelling of my lips from diclofenac, so I stay away from it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.95,
      "end_seconds": 131.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Have you had any rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.89,
      "end_seconds": 133.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "No, no rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.54,
      "end_seconds": 137.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Did you get joint swelling or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.53,
      "end_seconds": 144.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Erm, no joint swelling or fever, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.25,
      "end_seconds": 154.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.93,
      "end_seconds": 157.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.82,
      "end_seconds": 178.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.86,
      "end_seconds": 189.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Okay, bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.45,
      "end_seconds": 216.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 75, saturation 98 percent, blood pressure 112 over 68, temperature 36.7."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.22,
      "end_seconds": 222.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.98,
      "end_seconds": 225.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.02,
      "end_seconds": 227.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.06,
      "end_seconds": 246.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "The thigh muscles are tender and the strength is slightly reduced."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.1,
      "end_seconds": 249.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.69,
      "end_seconds": 262.47,
      "duration_seconds": 10.78,
      "text": "You can sit up now. So where does that leave us? The most likely explanation is muscle symptoms possibly from the cholesterol tablet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.7,
      "end_seconds": 309.02,
      "duration_seconds": 31.32,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a vitamin D level for muscle aches. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I think a creatine kinase test makes sense here, for muscle aches. We will pause the statin for a few weeks while we check the blood tests. If it hasn't settled next month, we'd think about a thyroid test, but not now. We'll catch up after the results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.28,
      "end_seconds": 310.98,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.73,
      "end_seconds": 317.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.49,
      "end_seconds": 320.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
